an edit: a fact retracted, one appended: the facts held are a fresh load's, in order (10 facts, revision 2)
a rebuild: runs kept, facts put between them, a twin dropped: the facts held are a fresh load's, in order (12 facts, revision 3)
its changes, as diff says them: the same 153 characters
a predicate emptied, and one that was empty filled: the facts held are a fresh load's, in order (11 facts, revision 4)
